<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-GB"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><link rel="profile" href="http://gmpg.org/xfn/11"><link rel="pingback" href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/xmlrpc.php"><script async src="https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=UA-167984142-1"></script><script>window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || []; function gtag(){dataLayer.push(arguments);} gtag('js', new Date()); gtag('config', 'UA-167984142-1');</script><link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/apple-touch-icon.png"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/favicon-32x32.png"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/favicon-16x16.png"><link rel="manifest" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/site.webmanifest"><link rel="mask-icon" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/safari-pinned-tab.svg" color="#5bbad5"><link rel="shortcut icon" href="https://branding.gasci.com/fi/favicon.ico"><meta name="msapplication-TileColor" content="#2b5797"><meta name="msapplication-config" content="/fi/browserconfig.xml"><meta name="theme-color" content="#ffffff"><script>function fvmuag(){if(navigator.userAgent.match(/x11.*fox\/54|oid\s4.*xus.*ome\/62|oobot|ighth|tmetr|eadles|ingdo/i))return!1;if(navigator.userAgent.match(/x11.*ome\/75\.0\.3770\.100/i)){var e=screen.width,t=screen.height;if("number"==typeof e&&"number"==typeof t&&862==t&&1367==e)return!1}return!0}</script><title>Demerara Distillers Limited | Guyana Stock Exchange Inc.</title><meta property="og:locale" content="en_GB"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:title" content="Demerara Distillers Limited | Guyana Stock Exchange Inc."/><meta property="og:url" content="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-distillers-limited/"/><meta property="og:site_name" content="Guyana Stock Exchange Inc."/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Demerara Distillers Limited | Guyana Stock Exchange Inc."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-distillers-limited/"/><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"item":{"@id":"https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/","name":"Guyana Stock Exchange Inc."}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"item":{"@id":"https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security-type/ordinary-shares/","name":"Ordinary Shares"}},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"item":{"@id":"https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-distillers-limited/","name":"Demerara Distillers Limited"}}]}</script><style type="text/css" media="all">@font-face{font-family:'Noto Serif';font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-stretch:normal;src:url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/notoserif/v33/ga6saw1J5X9T9RW6j9bNfFIMZhhWnFTyNZIQD1-_FXP0RgnaOg9MYBNLg_cIrq0.woff) format('woff')}@font-face{font-family:'Noto Serif';font-style:italic;font-weight:700;font-stretch:normal;src:url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/notoserif/v33/ga6saw1J5X9T9RW6j9bNfFIMZhhWnFTyNZIQD1-_FXP0RgnaOg9MYBOshPcIrq0.woff) format('woff')}@font-face{font-family:'Noto Serif';font-display:block;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-stretch:normal;src:url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/notoserif/v33/ga6iaw1J5X9T9RW6j9bNVls-hfgvz8JcMofYTa32J4wsL2JAlAhZqFCTx8cM.woff) format('woff')}@font-face{font-family:'Noto Serif';font-display:block;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;font-stretch:normal;src:url(https://fonts.gstatic.com/s/notoserif/v33/ga6iaw1J5X9T9RW6j9bNVls-hfgvz8JcMofYTa32J4wsL2JAlAhZT1eTx8cM.woff) format('woff')}</style><link rel='stylesheet' id='fvm-header-0-css' href='https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/cache/fvm/1759280682/out/header-39879a3be031dd10f0fc341162d58b61f5b4420e.min.css' type='text/css' media='all'/><script type='text/javascript' src='https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/wp-includes/js/jquery/jquery.js' id='jquery-core-js'></script><script type='text/javascript' src='https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/assets/js/chart.js' id='chart-js'></script><script type='text/javascript' src='https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/cache/fvm/1759280682/out/header-3afae13aa1a25beeb109a30bd2eaf7523b55eb03.min.js' id='fvm-header-1-js'></script><link rel="https://api.w.org/" href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/wp-json/"/><style type="text/css">.recentcomments a{display:inline !important;padding:0 !important;margin:0 !important;}</style></head><body class="security-template-default single single-security demerara-distillers-limited security dwpb-push-page group-blog"><div id="page" class="site"> <a class="skip-link screen-reader-text" href="#content">Skip to content</a> <header id="masthead" class="site-header" role="banner"><div class="site-contact group"><div class="wrapper group"><div class="dropdown"><div class="menu-label">Help</div> <nav class="help-menu"><div class="menu-help-container"><ul id="menu-help" class="menu"><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/faqs/">FAQs</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/glossary/">Glossary</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/buying-selling-shares/">Buying &#038; Selling Shares</a></li></ul></div> </nav></div> <nav class="secondary"><div class="menu-secondary-container"><ul id="menu-secondary" class="menu"><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/about-us/">About Us</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/articles/">Articles</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/legal-framework/">Legal Framework</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/news/">News</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/links/">L