Brokers</a></li></ul></div><div class="menu-secondary-container"><ul id="menu-secondary-1" class="menu"><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/about-us/">About Us</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/articles/">Articles</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/legal-framework/">Legal Framework</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/news/">News</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/links/">Links</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/previous-website/">Previous Website</a></li></ul></div><div class="menu-help-container"><ul id="menu-help-1" class="menu"><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/faqs/">FAQs</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/glossary/">Glossary</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/buying-selling-shares/">Buying &#038; Selling Shares</a></li></ul></div></div> </nav> <nav class="primary"><div class="menu-primary-container"><ul id="menu-primary-1" class="menu"><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/ai-tutor/">AI Tutor</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/trades/">Trades</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/financials/">Financials</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/market-capitalisation/">Market Capitalisation</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/securities/">Securities</a></li><li class="menu-item"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/brokers/">Brokers</a></li></ul></div></nav></div></div></div> </header> <main id="site-content" class="site-content"><div class="site-ticker"><div class="wrapper"><div class="stock-ticker"><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/banks-dih-holdings-inc/">bdh</a></div><div class="closing">155</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/guyana-bank-for-trade-and-industry-limited/">bti</a></div><div class="closing">2500</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/citizens-bank-guyana-incorporated/">cbi</a></div><div class="closing">388</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/caribbean-container-incorporated/">cci</a></div><div class="closing">149</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-bank-limited/">dbl</a></div><div class="closing">279</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="negative"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-distillers-limited/">ddl</a></div><div class="closing">295</div><div class="change"><span>-</span>2 (0.67%)</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/demerara-tobacco-company-limited/">dtc</a></div><div class="closing">3000</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/guyana-stockfeeds-incorporated/">gsi</a></div><div class="closing">112</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/j-p-santos-company-limited/">jps</a></div><div class="closing">20</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/property-holdings-incorporated/">phi</a></div><div class="closing">14</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="negative"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/republic-bank-guyana-limited/">rbl</a></div><div class="closing">539.9</div><div class="change"><span>-</span>0.1 (0.02%)</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/rupununi-development-company-limited/">rdl</a></div><div class="closing">500</div></div></div></div><div class="item"><div class="stock"><div class="same"><div class="security"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/security/sterling-products-limited/">spl</a></div><div class="closing">841.5</div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="feature background group" style="background:url(https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/gse/sec/media/financing-2380158_1920-1600x1067.jpg) no-repeat center 50%; background-size:cover;"><div class="overlay"><div class="wrapper"><div class="content"><h1><div class="title">Demerara Distillers Limited</div></h1></div></div></div></div> <main id="main" class="site-main wrapper group" role="main"><div class="sidebar col span-3"><div class="feed"><div class="bulletins"><h3>Bulletins</h3><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#26310" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="26310" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Distillers Limited will hold their 74th Annual General Meeting on Friday April 17 2026 at 4:30 p.m. at the National Stadium, Providence, East Bank Demerara.</p></div><span class ="number 218"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/218/">Bulletin 218</a></span><span class="date">March 2026</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#26248" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Proposes Final Dividend of $1.60 for 2025</a></div><div id="26248" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors met on Thursday, February 19, 2026 and recommended a Final Dividend of $1.60 per share for the year ended December 31, 2025. This will bring the total dividend for the year to $2.00 per share.</p></div><span class ="number 217"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/217/">Bulletin 217</a></span><span class="date">February 2026</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24807" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="24807" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Distillers Limited will hold their 73rd Annual General Meeting on Tuesday April 22 2025 at 4:30 p.m. at the DSL Tarmac, Block R, Plantation Great Diamond, East Bank Demerara.</p></div><span class ="number 211"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/211/">Bulletin 211</a></span><span class="date">March 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24497" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Proposes Final Dividend of $1.60 for 2024</a></div><div id="24497" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors met on Thursday, February 20, 2025 and recommended a Final Dividend of $1.60 per share for the year ended December 31, 2024. This will bring the total dividend for the year to $2.00 per share.</p></div><span class ="number 210"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/210/">Bulletin 210</a></span><span class="date">February 2025</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24175" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Ltd. (DDL) &#8211; proposes $0.40 per share Interim Dividend for 2024</a></div><div id="24175" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Distillers Ltd. met on November 21, 2024 and approved an Interim Dividend of $0.40 per share for 2024.</p></div><span class ="number 209"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/209/">Bulletin 209</a></span><span class="date">November 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24180" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Notice of Cessation of Mr. Rudolph Collins as Director</a></div><div id="24180" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Distillers Limited has advised that Mr. Rudolph Collins has ceased to be a Director of the company from September 2024.</p></div><span class ="number 208"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/208/">Bulletin 208</a></span><span class="date">October 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#24179" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Notice of Cessation of Mr. Egbert Carter as Director</a></div><div id="24179" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Distillers Limited has advised that Mr. Egbert Carter has ceased to be a Director of the company from July 2024.</p></div><span class ="number 206"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/206/">Bulletin 206</a></span><span class="date">July 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#22901" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="22901" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Distillers Limited will hold their 72nd Annual General Meeting on Friday April 19, 2024 at 4:30 p.m. at the Parking Lot of the Guyana National Stadium, Providence, East Bank Demerara.</p></div><span class ="number 203"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/203/">Bulletin 203</a></span><span class="date">March 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#22667" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Proposes Final Dividend of $1.60 for 2023</a></div><div id="22667" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors met on Thursday, February 15, 2024 and recommended a Final Dividend of $1.60 per share for the year ended December 31, 2023. This will bring the total dividend for the year to $2.00 per share.</p></div><span class ="number 202"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/202/">Bulletin 202</a></span><span class="date">February 2024</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#20920" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="20920" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Distillers Limited will hold its 71st Annual General Meeting on Friday, April 21, 2023, at 4:30 p.m. at the Parking Lot of the Guyana National Stadium, Providence, East Bank Demerara.</p></div><span class ="number 193"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/193/">Bulletin 193</a></span><span class="date">March 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#20856" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Proposes Final Dividend of $1.35 for 2022</a></div><div id="20856" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors met on Tuesday, February 28, 2023 and recommended a Final Dividend of $1.35 for the year ended December 31, 2022. This will bring the total dividend for the year to $1.75 per share.</p></div><span class ="number 192"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/192/">Bulletin 192</a></span><span class="date">February 2023</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#20231" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Ltd. (DDL) &#8211; proposes $0.40 per share Interim Dividend for 2022</a></div><div id="20231" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Distillers Ltd. met on October 20, 2022 and approved an Interim Dividend of $0.40 per share for 2022.</p></div><span class ="number 189"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/189/">Bulletin 189</a></span><span class="date">October 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#19493" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="19493" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Distillers Limited will hold their 70th Annual General Meeting on Thursday May 12, 2022 at 4:00 p.m. at 214 Camp Street, North Cummingsburg, Georgetown.</p><p>&#8220;In light of the restrictions on public gatherings imposed under the Health Ordinance as a result of the Coronavirus global pandemic (COVID-19), the AGM will be conducted in the manner directed under Order of Court dated 15th day of March, 2022 and entered on the 25th day of March 2022 to wit:</p><ol><li>no more than seven individuals (whose names are set out at (i) to (vii) below) representing, personally or by proxy, no less than 40% of the shareholding of DDL shall be present, in the capacity solely as shareholders, at the AGM namely;<ol><li>Chandra Gajraj, Trust Company (Guyana) Ltd.</li><li>Maurice John, Hand in Hand Trust Corp. Inc.</li><li>Roger Yee, Guyana &amp; Trinidad Mutual Group of Companies.</li><li>Phillip Fernandes, JP Santos &amp; Co. Ltd.</li><li>Khemraj Goberdhan, Diamond Fire &amp; General Insurance Inc.</li><li>Ede Tyrell</li><li>Colin Thompson</li></ol></li><li>as a shareholder of DDL, you are entitled to observe the AGM via electronic/virtual platform but not to be physically present at the Meeting. The access code for the electronic/virtual platform has been mailed to you along with this Notice;</li><li>as a shareholder of DDL, you are entitled to appoint one of the seven individuals named at (a) above as your proxy with instructions as to voting on the Motions to be proposed at the AGM. These Motions are set out in the Proxy Form, mailed to you along with this Notice;</li><li>shareholders may contact the Company Secretary&#8217;s Office at telephone numbers 592-265-2089 or 592-265-6000 or email: csec@demrum.com to address any questions in relation to this Notice or the AGM.&#8221;</li></ol></div><span class ="number 185"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/185/">Bulletin 185</a></span><span class="date">April 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#19932" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Proposes Final Dividend of $1.15 for 2021</a></div><div id="19932" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors met on Thursday, March 17, 2022 and recommended a Final Dividend of $1.15 for the year ended December 31, 2021. This brings the total dividend for the year to $1.55 per share.</p></div><span class ="number 184"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/184/">Bulletin 184</a></span><span class="date">March 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#19056" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Appointment of Director</a></div><div id="19056" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Mr. Joseph Singh is appointed  as a Non-Executive Director of Demerara Distillers Limited effective February 7, 2022.</p></div><span class ="number 183"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/183/">Bulletin 183</a></span><span class="date">February 2022</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#18207" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Ltd. (DDL) &#8211; proposes $0.40 per share Interim Dividend for 2021</a></div><div id="18207" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Distillers Ltd. met on October 21, 2021 and approved an Interim Dividend of $0.40 per share for 2021.</p></div><span class ="number 180"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/180/">Bulletin 180</a></span><span class="date">October 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#17131" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="17131" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Distillers Limited will hold their 69th Annual General Meeting on Friday April 23, 2021 at 4:00 p.m. at 214 Camp Street, North Cummingsburg, Georgetown.</p><p>&#8220;In light of the restrictions on public gatherings imposed under the Health Ordinance as a result of the Coronavirus global pandemic (COVID-19), the AGM will be conducted in the manner directed under Order of Court dated 3rd day of March, 2021 and entered on the 9th day of March 2021 to wit:</p><ol><li>no more than seven individuals (whose names are set out at (i) to (vii) below) representing, personally or by proxy, no less than 40% of the shareholding of DDL shall be present, in the capacity solely as shareholders, at the AGM namely;<ol><li>Chandra Gajraj, Trust Company (Guyana) Ltd.</li><li>Maurice John, Hand in Hand Trust Corp. Inc.</li><li>Phillip Fernandes, JP Santos &amp; Co. Ltd.</li><li>Khemraj Goberdhan, Diamond Fire &amp; General Insurance Inc.</li><li>Rajnarine Singh, Sannap Manufacturing Co. Ltd.</li><li>Ede Tyrell</li><li>Colin Thompson</li></ol></li><li>as a shareholder of DDL, you are entitled to observe the AGM via electronic/virtual platform but not to be physically present at the Meeting. The access code for the electronic/virtual platform has been mailed to you along with this Notice;</li><li>as a shareholder of DDL, you are entitled to appoint one of the seven individuals named at (a) above as your proxy with instructions as to voting on the Motions to be proposed at the AGM. These Motions are set out in the Proxy Form, mailed to you along with this Notice;</li><li>shareholders may contact the Company Secretary&#8217;s Office at telephone numbers 592-265-2089 or 592-265-6000 or email: csec@demrum.com to address any questions in relation to this Notice or the AGM.&#8221;</li></ol></div><span class ="number 173"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/173/">Bulletin 173</a></span><span class="date">March 2021</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#16664" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Ltd. (DDL) &#8211; proposes $0.30 per share Interim Dividend for 2020</a></div><div id="16664" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors of Demerara Distillers Ltd. met on November 19, 2020 and approved an Interim Dividend of $0.30 per share for 2020.</p></div><span class ="number 171"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/171/">Bulletin 171</a></span><span class="date">November 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#16129" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="16129" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Distillers Limited will hold their 68th Annual General Meeting on Friday October 9, 2020 at 4:00 p.m. at 214 Camp Street, North Cummingsburg, Georgetown.</p><p>Here is an extract of the Notice of Annual General Meeting:</p><p>&#8220;In light of the restrictions on public gatherings imposed under the Health Ordinance as a result of the Coronavirus global pandemic (COVID-19), the AGM will be conducted in the manner directed under Order of Court dated and entered on the 4th day of September 2020 to wit:</p><p>(a)     no more than seven individuals (whose names are set out at (i) to (vii) below) representing, personally or by proxy, no less than 40% of the shareholding of DDL shall be present, in the capacity solely as shareholders, at the AGM namely;</p><p>(i)         Chandra Gajraj, Trust Company (Guyana) Ltd.</p><p>(ii)        Maurice John, Hand in Hand Trust Corp. Inc.</p><p>(iii)       Phillip Fernandes, JP Santos &amp; Co. Ltd.</p><p>(iv)       Khemraj Goberdhan, Diamond Fire &amp; General Insurance Inc.</p><p>(v)        Rajnarine Singh, Sannap Manufacturing Co. Ltd.</p><p>(vi)       Ede Tyrell</p><p>(vii)      Colin Thompson</p><p>(b)     as a shareholder of DDL, you are entitled to observe the AGM via electronic/virtual platform but not to be physically present at the Meeting. The access code for the electronic/virtual platform has been mailed to you along with this Notice;</p><p>(c)     as a shareholder of DDL, you are entitled to appoint one of the seven individuals named at (a) above as your proxy with instructions as to voting on the Motions to be proposed at the AGM.  These Motions are set out in the Proxy Form, mailed to you along with this Notice;</p><p>(d)     shareholders may contact the Company Secretary&#8217;s Office at telephone numbers 592-265-2089 or 592-265-6000 or email: csec@demrum.com to address any questions in relation to this Notice or the AGM.&#8221;</p></div><span class ="number 169"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/169/">Bulletin 169</a></span><span class="date">September 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#15711" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Annual General Meeting</a></div><div id="15711" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>Demerara Distillers Limited will hold their 68th Annual General Meeting on Friday April 3, 2020 at 4:30 p.m. at DDL&#8217;s Diamond Complex, Plantation  Great Diamond, East Bank Demerara.</p></div><span class ="number 164"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/164/">Bulletin 164</a></span><span class="date">March 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#15708" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Limited (DDL) &#8211; Proposes Final Dividend of $0.90 for 2019</a></div><div id="15708" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Board of Directors met on Thursday, February 20, 2020 and recommended a Final Dividend of $0.90 for the year ended December 31, 2019. This brings the total dividend for the year to $1.15 per share.</p></div><span class ="number 163"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/163/">Bulletin 163</a></span><span class="date">February 2020</span></div></div><div class="bulletin"><div class="info group"><div class="title"><a href="#13147" class="inline-popup">Demerara Distillers Ltd. (DDL) &#8211; proposes $0.25 per share Interim Dividend for 2019</a></div><div id="13147" class="mfp-hide popup-content" ><p>The Directors of Demerara Distillers Ltd. met and recommended an Interim Dividend of $0.25 per share for 2019.</p></div><span class ="number 160"><a href="https://guyanastockexchangeinc.com/bulletin-number/160/">Bulletin 160</a></span><span class="date">September 2019</span></div></div></div></div></div><div id="primary" class="content-area col span-9"><h2> Financials</h2><div class="carousel financials financial-nav"><div class="slide" id="2026">2026</div><div class="slide" id="2025">2025</div><div class="slide" id="2024">2024</div><div class="slide" id="2023">2023</div><div class="slide" id="2022">2022</div><div class="slide" id="2021">2021</div><div class="slide" id="2020">2020</div><div class="slide" id="2019">2019</div><div class="slide" id="2018">2018</div></div><div class="small">-->Select Year</div><div class="slider financials financial-years"><div class="year slide" id="2026"><h3>2026</h3><div class="fin-data"><tab